      "summary": "An identity for a community pickleball club built around movement, connection and shared experiences.",
      "services": [
        "Brand Identity",
        "Brand Guidelines",
        "Art Direction",
        "Motion",
        "Merchandise",
        "Social"
      ],
      "info": "The Commons is a neighbourhood pickleball club where the court is the meeting point. The identity pairs Rally Orange with Court Violet, Club Canvas and Ace Lilac. A ball-dot motif and a looped logomark carry the system from the court to the café counter. The tone is warm, social and a little competitive: Rally. Connect. Repeat.",
