          "image": "assets/media/works/the-commons/comp-1-1-poster.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "heading": "The idea",
          "body": "Court time > screen time. The brand positions the club as a third place — somewhere to play, linger and meet people. Every touchpoint borrows from the game: ball perforations, court lines and the rhythm of a rally."
