      ],
      "info": "1000 Burgers is built around one idea: counting. The identity uses a stacked numeral system in deep burgundy and cream. It appears on bags, boxes, fry sleeves, dip cups and staff tees, alongside lines like “Keep ’em coming” and “Too hungry to count.” Motion and social content bring the count to life.",
